From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ugur-imd <ugur.acikgoz@imd-tec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:00:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] configs: imdt-v2n-sbc: enable USB fastboot for LAVA
 deploy

Needed for the same fastboot-via-uboot deploy method already used for
imdt-v2h-sbc in lava/fastboot-deploy.yaml. FASTBOOT_BUF_ADDR reuses
imdt-v2h-sbc's exact value (0x62000000, size 0x10000000): it sits
inside the cma-default reserved-memory region in both boards' kernel
DTS (which both start at 0x58000000), the same way SYS_LOAD_ADDR does
- safe because, like SYS_LOAD_ADDR, it is only used transiently by
u-boot before the kernel's own reservation takes effect.
---
 configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig b/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
index d5e017c..4797df1 100644
--- a/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
@@ -88,3 +88,8 @@ CONFIG_CMD_SF=y
 CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_MACRONIX=y
 CONFIG_BOARD_SIZE_LIMIT=1572864
 CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_LEN=0x4000000
+CONFIG_USB_FUNCTION_FASTBOOT=y
+CONFIG_FASTBOOT_BUF_ADDR=0x62000000
+CONFIG_FASTBOOT_BUF_SIZE=0x10000000
+CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH=y
+CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH_MMC_DEV=0
-- 
2.34.1

